OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GThis Evening and Tonight:FRain         
OL,8,Fgradually eases across southwest       
OL,9,FEngland and Wales, clearing westwards. 
OL,10,FFurther rain persists across much of   
OL,11,FScotland, with strong coastal winds    
OL,12,Fand snow over the hills. Elsewhere,    
OL,13,Fremaining dry but rather cloudy, with  
OL,14,Ffog possible in Northern Ireland.      
OL,16,GWednesday:FWet to start across parts   
OL,17,Fof Northern Ireland and Scotland,      
OL,18,Fwintry across Scottish hills, turning  
OL,19,Fdrier. Brightening skies across much   
OL,20,Fof England and Wales. Feeling chilly   
OL,21,Fin an easterly breeze.                 
OL,23,D]C        From the Met Office          
