OL,4,CTwo arrested on suspicion of burglary  
OL,5,Cat Prince and Princess of Wales's      
OL,6,CNorfolk home                           
OL,7,GTwo men have been arrested on          
OL,8,Gsuspicion of burglary and trespass at  
OL,9,Gthe Prince and Princess of Wales's     
OL,10,Gcountry home on the Sandringham        
OL,11,Gestate, police say.                    
OL,13,FNorfolk Police said it received a call 
OL,14,Fjust before 18:00 GMT on Monday        
OL,15,Ffollowing a report of suspicious       
OL,16,Factivity at Anmer Hall.                
OL,18,FPolice deployed dogs, drones and a     
OL,19,Fhelicopter to search the area and      
OL,20,Farrested two men on the estate, who    
OL,21,Fremain in custody.                     
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
