OL,4,CIndian government has 'lost the plot', 
OL,5,Csays 'cockroach' leader barred from UK 
OL,6,Cflight                                 
OL,7,GOne of the leaders of India's          
OL,8,G"cockroach" movement has said the      
OL,9,GDelhi government has "completely lost  
OL,10,Gthe plot" after he was stopped from    
OL,11,Gleaving the country for the UK.        
OL,13,FSaurav Das said he was meant to board  
OL,14,Fa flight on Tuesday morning but was    
OL,15,Ftold by immigration officers his       
OL,16,Fpassport had been "flagged" because of 
OL,17,Fdiscrepancies involving his date of    
OL,18,Fbirth.                                 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
